      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "こんばんは、マギーさん。\n僕はただの夜の散歩ですよ。\nマギーさんこそ、何をしているんですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "79528de4151d790e0014d226d786e2763b480c7570764cf26fa1628d3046ff7c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "안녕하세요, 매기 씨.\n저는 그냥 밤 산책이에요.\n매기 씨야말로 뭘 하고 계세요?",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 24,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b006-20261106-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "54e382cd1d9affe6ca78e5de20be4bfacc72095a2a0cf6b6fdfda748378a90e4:000002_8684810671974196726:g0:r23",
      "row_index_0based": 23,
      "serialized_row_index": 23,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "こんばんは、マギーさん。\n僕はただの夜の散歩ですよ。\nマギーさんこそ、何をしているんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "7dcd3f95d12b126ea66ee119bc4da383db32b77ab06d5af96397f05b673fb2e1",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "私も似たようなものかな。ちょっと星を見に来たの。\nほら、今日は晴れてて、夜空がすごく綺麗だから。",
      "jp_sha256": "33b1e5ccde3bfabb63fdd812117d567f3d4fa5cae9039f2a9ddcf80f7675df29",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "나도 비슷해. 별을 좀 보러 왔어.\n봐, 오늘은 맑아서 밤하늘이 정말 아름답잖아.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 25,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b006-20261106-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "54e382cd1d9affe6ca78e5de20be4bfacc72095a2a0cf6b6fdfda748378a90e4:000002_8684810671974196726:g0:r24",
